10	/**
11	 * De-duplicates the assigned {@code customerCode}. If another owner already holds the
12	 * computed code, appends {@code -<n>} with the smallest {@code n >= 2} that is unique.
13	 * The owner is not yet saved, so its own code is absent from the store.
14	 */
